The Emerald Xcursor theme is a recolored derivative of Bibata Cursor.

  Upstream: https://github.com/ful1e5/Bibata_Cursor
  Author:   Abdulkaiz Khatri (ful1e5)
  License:  GNU General Public License v3.0

The build fetches Bibata's GPL-3.0 SVG sources, substitutes its color
sentinels for the CachyOS Emerald palette (cursors/emerald-palette.conf),
rasterizes with librsvg, and packages the Xcursor set with clickgen's
ctgen using Bibata's own X11 build manifest.  Only the color mapping and
theme metadata are changed; the cursor geometry and hotspots are Bibata's.

This derivative is distributed under GPL-3.0, matching both Bibata and
this repository's license.
